<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>winter weather, cold, frost,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.487
			</span></i>: then, <i>winter</i> as a season of the year, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείματος ὥρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					450
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔποτε καρπὸς ἀπολείπει χείματος
					οὐδὲ θέρευς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				76
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέροντας χ. καὶ θέρος
			βροτοῖς,</span> of the stars, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε χείματος τέκμαρ οὔτ᾽ ἀνθεμώδους
					ἦρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					454
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖμα</span> in acc., during
				<i>winter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.190
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				640
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					293
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>storm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. πῦρ τε δάϊον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					79
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
				100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				199
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				627
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				748
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλλιστον ἦμαρ εἰσιδεῖν ἐκ χείματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					900
				</span></i>
			.—Poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμών,</span> used also in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				371d
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>héman</i> 'in winter', Lith.
				<i>žiemà</i> 'winter', etc.)</div>
